      "a": "Oregon received $1.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense obligated $913M, the Department of Agriculture obligated $190M, and the Department of Transportation obligated $139M. Total award count is 7,747 and the average award size is $206K. Fiscal-year comparisons show FY25 at $2.1B and FY23 at $2.5B."
